        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "the second step involved removal of the solvent and formation of the film; the polymer=solvent solution was poured into a flat glass container, the solvent was removed via evaporation at room temperature under a fume hood for a period of 24 hr and for 12 hr in an oven at a temperature of 40 °C."
